From: Andy Zhang and contributors (see kernel/third-party/README.md for imported parts)
Subject: [PATCH 0008/8] Battery manager charge limit and dwc3-qcom resume fix

qcom_battmgr: software charge limit (80/75 % hysteresis) through the Xiaomi input_suspend, USB input-current limit, adapter type.
dwc3-qcom: re-apply the UTMI-as-pipe-clock selection on resume.
Some parts from ROCKNIX (0051/0052/0054), the charge limit and the resume fix are this project's.

Apply with: git apply (from the root of a Linux 7.3 tree).
---
